\pard\sa120\sb120\fs28\b Description\b0{\*\bkmkstart description}{\*\bkmkend description}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Lets any OneView automation task accept EITHER a server name or a serial number. In BOTH cases the target is resolved to its OneView server record (hostname + iLO IP) via Get-OneViewServerTarget, so destructive operations always deploy to / reboot / build the confirmed OneView server and never a free-floating name.\par
